/(abc/: 0: unclosed group
/a(b(c)/: 1: unclosed group
/abc)/: 3: unmatched ')'
/[abc/: 0: unclosed class
/[z-a]/: 1: bad class range
/[a-\d]/: 1: bad class range
/[\w-z]/: 1: bad class range
/(a)\1/: 3: back references are not supported: the engine is linear-time
/(?<x>a)\k<x>/: 7: back references are not supported: the engine is linear-time
/a(?=b)/: 1: lookahead is not supported: the engine is linear-time
/a(?!b)/: 1: lookahead is not supported: the engine is linear-time
/(?<=a)b/: 0: lookbehind is not supported: the engine is linear-time
/(?<!a)b/: 0: lookbehind is not supported: the engine is linear-time
/a{2000}/: 1: repeat count above 1000
/a{1,2000}/: 1: repeat count above 1000
/a{3,2}/: 1: repeat counts out of order
/(?:a{1000}){20}/: 0: the pattern compiles to more than 10000 instructions
/*a/: 0: nothing to repeat
/a**/: 2: nothing to repeat
/a{2}+/: 4: nothing to repeat
/^*/: 1: nothing to repeat
/\b+/: 2: nothing to repeat
/abc\/: 3: the pattern ends with a backslash
/\q/: 0: unknown escape \q
/\p{L}/: 0: Unicode property escapes are not supported
/\x4/: 0: \x must be followed by two hex digits
/\u12/: 0: \u must be followed by four hex digits or {...}
/\u{110000}/: 0: \u{...} escape above 10FFFF
/\u{}/: 0: bad \u{...} escape
/\c1/: 0: \c must be followed by a letter
/(?<1a>x)/: 3: bad group name
/(?<>x)/: 3: bad group name
/(?<a>x)(?<a>y)/: 7: group name "a" is used twice
/(?x)/: 0: bad group: expected a flag (i, m or s), `:`, `<name>`
/(?)/: 0: bad group: expected a flag (i, m or s), `:`, `<name>`
/(?i/: 0: bad group: expected a flag (i, m or s), `:`, `<name>`
3,000 groups: 0: the pattern needs more than 1000000 thread slots (instructions times groups and repeats)
